WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.139
Wow! Time sure does fly!

2
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:16.241
This is our last day in the U.S.A.

3
00:00:16.242 --> 00:00:19.286
Sunny: I wish you could stay longer, Young-hee.

4
00:00:19.287 --> 00:00:23.474
Mom: Me too, but my husband and Hada need me.

5
00:00:23.475 --> 00:00:25.908
Bada: Can I stay here, Mom?

6
00:00:25.909 --> 00:00:31.222
Sunny: Yes, you can live with us!

7
00:00:31.223 --> 00:00:34.908
Hana: My suitcase won't close, Mom!

8
00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:38.149
Mom: I think you have too many things, Hana.

9
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.508
Hana: That's from the zoo.

10
00:00:40.509 --> 00:00:43.445
That's from Tom!

11
00:00:43.446 --> 00:00:46.813
Tom: Did you enjoy your trip to the U.S.A.?

12
00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:49.797
Hana: We had a great time!

13
00:00:49.798 --> 00:00:51.993
Tom: How about you, Bada?

14
00:00:51.994 --> 00:01:00.207
Bada: I'm going to live with Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom.

15
00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:02.615
Tom: It was so nice to meet you.

16
00:01:02.616 --> 00:01:05.235
Come back and visit soon.

17
00:01:05.236 --> 00:01:08.619
Hana: I hope you can come to visit Korea.

18
00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:12.022
Tom: I hope so.

19
00:01:12.023 --> 00:01:15.263
Tom: Time flies by so quickly.

20
00:01:15.264 --> 00:01:18.520
Mom: It feels like we just came yesterday.

21
00:01:18.521 --> 00:01:21.722
Bada: Why do we have to go so soon?

22
00:01:21.723 --> 00:01:25.515
Mom: Don't you miss Daddy and Hada?

23
00:01:25.516 --> 00:01:27.856
Sunny: I'm going to miss you!

24
00:01:27.857 --> 00:01:30.248
Mom: Come and visit us in Korea.

25
00:01:30.249 --> 00:01:32.011
Tom: We will.

26
00:01:32.012 --> 00:01:37.297
Sunny: Oh, Young-hee, thank you for everything.

27
00:01:37.298 --> 00:01:39.282
Hana: Good-bye, Aunt Sunny.

28
00:01:39.283 --> 00:01:41.571
Good-bye, Uncle Tom!

29
00:01:41.572 --> 00:01:43.173
Bada: Good-bye!

30
00:01:43.174 --> 00:01:47.802
Sunny & Tom: Good-bye! Take care!

31
00:01:47.803 --> 00:01:52.703
It was hard to say good-bye to Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom.

32
00:01:52.704 --> 00:01:58.483
But we were looking forward to seeing Daddy and Hada.
